  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Community Resilience in Tanzania: A Human Security Approach to Building Resilience in Tanzania amid Regional Challenges in the Great Lakes (Enhancing Response capacity of communities and government by establishing multipurpose</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to strengthen resilience in Tanzania&#x2019;s border communities by addressing escalating human security threats linked to conflict in the DRC and post-election unrest in 2025. It focuses on safeguarding physical safety, protecting livelihoods and trade, reinforcing social cohesion and trust&#x2014;especially among youth&#x2014;and supporting psychological recovery for communities affected by violence and trauma</narrative>
  </description>
